+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Original snow impacts</title><style>body{max-width:820px;margin:32px auto;padding:20px;background:#18212c;color:#f0f2f4;font:17px/1.5 system-ui}article{padding:16px 20px;background:#243243;margin:18px 0;border-radius:12px}h1,h2{color:#f0dda7}audio{width:100%}small{color:#b9c4cf}</style><h1>Original snow impact options</h1><p>Packed snow is installed. Every audition uses the same event gain, pitch, Vehicle compressor and Master limiter.</p><article><h2>Two hits each: previous, packed, powder, heavy bank</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="comparison.wav"></audio></article><article><h2>Previous snow impact</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="audition/before.wav"></audio></article><article><h2>Packed snow - installed</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="audition/packed.wav"></audio></article><article><h2>Powder drop</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="audition/powder.wav"></audio></article><article><h2>Heavy bank</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="audition/bank.wav"></audio></article><article><h2>Installed sound while driving into the bank</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="driving/driving.wav"></audio></article><p>The entry is denser and has more recorded low-body weight. Its strong attack remains within one millisecond. Continuous ploughing is unchanged.</p><small>Original composites from existing Nox Sound Design CC0 recordings. Soundsnap's previews did not play correctly in these tools, so no auditory comparison with those recordings is claimed and none of their audio is included. Desktop mastering/contact checks are recorded separately; owner and physical-device listening remain.</small><script>document.querySelectorAll('audio').forEach(p=>p.addEventListener('play',()=>document.querySelectorAll('audio').forEach(q=>{if(p!==q)q.pause()})))</script></html>
